Z||000004||fiero56||07-12-2000||08:06 PM||||Everyday I see many Mercedes and the like with turn signals built into the front of the side mirror housing. The turn signal light runs the length of the housing, and is about 1"-1 1/2" in height. The cool part is you can't tell there is a light in there until the turn signal is turned on.||||reg||1
